        "name": "Lucas-Lehmer Primality Test",
        "pseudocode": "LUCAS_LEHMER(p):\n  if p = 2: return True\n  M \u2190 2^p - 1\n  s \u2190 4\n  for i from 1 to p-2:\n    s \u2190 (s\u00b2 - 2) mod M\n  return s = 0\n\nTime: O(p\u00b2 log p), Space: O(p)",
        "code": "def lucas_lehmer(p: int) -> bool:\n    if p == 2: return True\n    M = (1 << p) - 1\n    s = 4\n    for _ in range(p - 2):\n        s = (s * s - 2) % M\n    return s == 0",
